Privacy Policy
Our Commitment to Your Privacy
At Expense Manager, we believe in complete transparency and your right to privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we handle your information.

What We Don't Collect
We do NOT collect, store, or process any Personal Information (PI) from our users. This includes but is not limited to: names, email addresses, phone numbers, home addresses, or identification documents.
Data Storage
All expense data you enter in Expense Manager is stored locally on your device. We do not transmit, store, or access this data on external servers. Your financial information remains entirely in your control.

No Third-Party Sharing
Since we don't collect personal information, there is nothing to share with third parties. We never sell, trade, or share your data with advertisers, analytics companies, or any other external entities.

Cookies and Tracking
We do not use cookies, pixel tags, or any tracking technologies to monitor your behavior or collect information about you.

Security
Your expense data is protected by your device's built-in security. We recommend:

Using strong device passwords or biometric authentication
Keeping your device operating system updated
Regularly backing up your important financial data
Your Rights
Since we don't collect personal data:

You have nothing to request deletion of
You have complete control over all your expense records
You can delete the app and all associated data at any time
Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the application. Your continued use of Expense Manager signifies your acceptance of our policy.

Contact Us
For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our practices, please don't hesitate to reach out. We're committed to addressing your privacy concerns promptly.

Remember: Your privacy is paramount. Expense Manager is designed with privacy-first principles to ensure your financial information remains completely under your control.
